<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Arthur Kaplan details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>Arthur Kaplan details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arthur Kaplan Jewellery Holdings Ltd said on Monday it would award capitalisation shares to shareholders on register on September 13.</p>
<p>The new shares would be issued at the rate of 2.3 ordinary shares for every 100 ordinary shares held.</p>
<p>Shareholders could elect to receive a 391 cents cash dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
